  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your telepathy can unsettle your enemies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Amoxa veryx.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As a move action, a number of times per day equal to your Wisdom modifier you can shriek telepathically at a creature. The creature is forced to make a Will saving throw DC (10 + 1/2 character level + Wisdom modifier) or be become shaken for 1 round per character level. Multiple amoxa can use this ability to Aid Another a standard action. If they do so they can increase the Will save DC by +2 per additonal amoxa to resist the shaken effect. This is a supernatural ability that counts as a mind-affecting fear effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/veryx#toc26\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
